WEBVTT

00:00:59.704 --> 00:01:02.704
That's roughly equivalent to the amount
of moisture in a banana.

00:01:02.746 --> 00:01:06.538
Lungs are more similar to an apple at 83%.

00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:11.538
And even seemingly dry 
human bones are 31% water.

00:01:12.704 --> 00:01:15.746
If we are essentially made of water,
and surrounded by water,

00:01:15.788 --> 00:01:18.871
why do we still need to drink so much?

00:01:18.913 --> 00:01:23.746
Well, each day we lose two to three
liters through our sweat,

00:01:23.788 --> 00:01:27.746
urine, and bowel movements,
and even just from breathing.

00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:30.246
While these functions
are essential to our survival,